{"seq":1,"slug":"measuring-transfer","title":"测量迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/transfer-of-learning/practice/measuring-transfer","wordCount":1370,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"测量迁移\">测量迁移</h1><p>「我们的训练显著提升了迁移能力」——这句话是怎么被证明或证伪的？答案藏在一个看似技术、实则决定一切的环节里：测验题怎么设计。把测验题设计得太像练习题，你测到的是机械记忆，会高估迁移；设计得太远，学习者全错，你又分不清是「没迁移」还是「题目本身太难」。测量迁移是一个比直觉棘手得多的方法论问题，读懂它，你才有能力判断一项迁移研究的结论可不可信——这也是下一篇<a href=\"transfer-pitfalls\">迁移的迷思与陷阱</a>清算劣质研究的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>测量迁移的本质，是用「与训练情境距离可控的一组测验题」去探测学习者能否跨越这段距离。核心设计是搭一个<strong>距离梯度</strong>：从与练习题几乎同形的同构题，到改变表面的近迁移题，再到改变更多、结构也需重新映射的远迁移题。一项训练在梯度上能走多远，就是它的迁移能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[训练/练习题] --&gt; B[同构题&lt;br/&gt;仅换数字]&#10;    A --&gt; C[近迁移题&lt;br/&gt;换表面外壳]&#10;    A --&gt; D[远迁移题&lt;br/&gt;换领域+需重映射]&#10;    B --&gt; E{表现衰减曲线}&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[衰减慢: 迁移强]&#10;    E --&gt; G[同构高、近远骤降:&lt;br/&gt;仅机械记忆]\">flowchart TD\n    A[训练/练习题] --&gt; B[同构题&lt;br/&gt;仅换数字]\n    A --&gt; C[近迁移题&lt;br/&gt;换表面外壳]\n    A --&gt; D[远迁移题&lt;br/&gt;换领域+需重映射]\n    B --&gt; E{表现衰减曲线}\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[衰减慢: 迁移强]\n    E --&gt; G[同构高、近远骤降:&lt;br/&gt;仅机械记忆]</pre><p>只测一个点是无意义的。只测同构题，分高只能说明记住了；只测远迁移题，分低无法定位失败原因。必须测整条梯度，看「表现随距离如何衰减」——这条衰减曲线才是迁移能力的真实画像。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/what-is-transfer\">什么是学习迁移</a>里「保持与迁移可分离」在测量上的落实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种威胁结论的陷阱\">四种威胁结论的陷阱</h2><p>设计迁移测验有四个反复让研究翻车的陷阱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>防范</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>天花板效应</td>\n<td>题太易，所有人满分</td>\n<td>测不出组间差异</td>\n<td>提高难度梯度上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地板效应</td>\n<td>远迁移题太难，所有人零分</td>\n<td>分不清没迁移还是题难</td>\n<td>设可达的中间梯度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测验污染</td>\n<td>迁移题混入了练过的成分</td>\n<td>高估迁移</td>\n<td>严格审查表面/结构重叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离混淆</td>\n<td>把「近迁移」当「远迁移」标</td>\n<td>夸大迁移距离</td>\n<td>独立编码深层结构差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最隐蔽的是「测验污染」与「距离混淆」。研究者常以为自己的迁移题足够远，实则它与练习题共享了某个未被察觉的结构成分，于是测到的「远迁移」其实是近迁移甚至同构。要排除它，需要由独立评判者按<a href=\"../mechanisms/abstraction-schema\">抽象与图式</a>里讲的「深层结构 vs 表面结构」区分，给每道题的迁移距离独立打标，而非由设计者自评。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个量化迁移的简单指标\">一个量化迁移的简单指标</h2><p>如何把「迁移了多少」变成一个数？一种常见做法是用迁移组与对照组在迁移测验上的标准化差异，即效应量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>迁移组</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>对照组</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>pooled</mtext></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\dfrac{\\bar{X}_{\\text{迁移组}} - \\bar{X}_{\\text{对照组}}}{s_{\\text{pooled}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4692em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pooled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">迁移组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">对照组</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这就是<a href=\"../teaching/varied-practice\">多样化与交错练习</a>里那些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.42</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g \\approx 0.42</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.42</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\approx 0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span> 数字的来源。但要警惕：效应量必须绑定「在哪个距离上测的」才有意义——同一训练在近迁移上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>、在远迁移上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 是常态，笼统报一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 而不说距离，几乎等于没说。</p>\n<p>另一类设计是「学习迁移」（learning-to-learn）范式：不直接测目标任务表现，而是测「学习新任务的速度」是否因先前训练而加快。这种「省下来的学习时间」是衡量纵向迁移（见<a href=\"../foundations/transfer-types\">迁移的类型</a>）的有力指标，常用于评估专长训练的效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这关系到每一个迁移声明\">为什么这关系到每一个迁移声明</h2><p>测量的严谨性直接决定了一个迁移声明的可信度。下一篇要清算的「脑力训练能提升智力」之类宣称，几乎都栽在测量上——它们往往只在与训练任务高度相似的近迁移题上显示效果，却被包装成「一般能力提升」。当代针对认知训练的二阶元分析之所以能给出「远迁移近乎为零」的清醒结论，靠的正是统一、严格的远迁移测量标准。换句话说，分不清近远、控不住污染，整个迁移领域就会沦为各说各话；测量是这个领域的诚信底线。</p>\n<p>这也与 <code>17_learning-analytics</code>（学习分析）的评估视角互补：那边偏用数据指标刻画学习过程，本篇偏实验设计的内部效度，二者合起来才构成对「学习有没有真发生迁移」的完整判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>测量迁移的核心是搭「同构题—近迁移题—远迁移题」的距离梯度，看表现随距离的衰减曲线。</li>\n<li>只测单点无意义：同构高只证明记住，远迁移低无法定位失败原因。</li>\n<li>四大陷阱：天花板、地板效应、测验污染、距离混淆；后两者最隐蔽，需独立评判者标距离。</li>\n<li>效应量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 必须绑定「在哪个距离上测」才有意义；近迁移强、远迁移弱是常态。</li>\n<li>测量严谨性是迁移领域的诚信底线，劣质迁移声明几乎都栽在测量上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"expertise-transfer\">专长与迁移</a> —— 学习迁移范式如何评估专长。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"transfer-pitfalls\">迁移的迷思与陷阱</a> —— 劣质测量如何制造假迁移声明。</li>\n<li>机制章：<a href=\"../mechanisms/abstraction-schema\">抽象与图式</a> —— 标注迁移距离所依赖的深层/表面区分。</li>\n<li>教学章：<a href=\"../teaching/varied-practice\">多样化与交错练习</a> —— 效应量数字的出处。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../learning-analytics/practice/validity-pitfalls\">学习分析 · 效度陷阱</a> —— 评估效度的数据视角互补。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测量迁移","id":"测量迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四种威胁结论的陷阱","id":"四种威胁结论的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"一个量化迁移的简单指标","id":"一个量化迁移的简单指标"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这关系到每一个迁移声明","id":"为什么这关系到每一个迁移声明"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"面向迁移的教学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/transfer-of-learning/teaching/teaching-for-transfer"},"next":{"title":"专长与迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/transfer-of-learning/practice/expertise-transfer"}}